@startuml 06-state-machine-waiting-request
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title State machine — Waiting request ("I'm waiting here")

[*] --> Waiting : register(stop, route?)\n[< 6 requests in the last hour]
Waiting : entry / publish waiting count
Waiting --> Waiting : register(same stop and route)\n/ return the existing request
Waiting --> Served : shuttle of a matching route\nreaches the stop
Waiting --> Cancelled : cancel()
Waiting --> Cancelled : register(different stop or route)\n[< 6 requests in the last hour]\n/ a new request replaces it
Waiting --> Expired : after(20 min)
Served --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Expired --> [*]

note as Retention
  For Served, Cancelled and Expired requests:
  24 h after closing, the pseudonymous requester
  reference is erased (retention job). The remaining
  row (stop, route, time, outcome) is non-personal
  demand data used for trends and forecasts.
end note
@enduml
